          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When on, the text you type is sent to %@. Nothing else is sent. When off, answers come from DuckDuckGo and Wikipedia only.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When on, the text you type is sent to %@. Nothing else is sent. When off, answers come from DuckDuckGo and Wikipedia only."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lorsque c'est activé, le texte que vous saisissez est envoyé à %@. Rien d'autre n'est envoyé. Lorsque c'est désactivé, les réponses viennent uniquement de DuckDuckGo et de Wikipédia."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Si está activado, el texto que escribes se envía a %@. No se envía nada más. Si está desactivado, las respuestas vienen solo de DuckDuckGo y Wikipedia."
          }
        },
        "zh": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "开启后，你输入的文字会发送给 %@，不发送其他任何内容。关闭后，答案只来自 DuckDuckGo 和维基百科。"
          }
        },
        "pa": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ਚਾਲੂ ਹੋਣ 'ਤੇ ਤੁਹਾਡਾ ਲਿਖਿਆ ਟੈਕਸਟ %@ ਨੂੰ ਭੇਜਿਆ ਜਾਂਦਾ ਹੈ। ਹੋਰ ਕੁਝ ਨਹੀਂ ਭੇਜਿਆ ਜਾਂਦਾ। ਬੰਦ ਹੋਣ 'ਤੇ ਜਵਾਬ ਸਿਰਫ਼ DuckDuckGo ਅਤੇ ਵਿਕੀਪੀਡੀਆ ਤੋਂ ਆਉਂਦੇ ਹਨ।"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "To answer, Nimble sends the text you type, and nothing else, to %@. No account, contacts, location or identifiers are sent, and Nimble keeps no record of it. If you don't allow this, answers come from DuckDuckGo and Wikipedia only. You can change this in Settings.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "To answer, Nimble sends the text you type, and nothing else, to %@. No account, contacts, location or identifiers are sent, and Nimble keeps no record of it. If you don't allow this, answers come from DuckDuckGo and Wikipedia only. You can change this in Settings."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pour répondre, Nimble envoie le texte que vous saisissez, et rien d'autre, à %@. Aucun compte, contact, position ni identifiant n'est envoyé, et Nimble n'en garde aucune trace. Si vous refusez, les réponses viennent uniquement de DuckDuckGo et de Wikipédia. Vous pouvez changer cela dans Réglages."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Para responder, Nimble envía el texto que escribes, y nada más, a %@. No se envía ninguna cuenta, contacto, ubicación ni identificador, y Nimble no guarda ningún registro. Si no lo permites, las respuestas vienen solo de DuckDuckGo y Wikipedia. Puedes cambiarlo en Ajustes."
          }
        },
        "zh": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "为了回答，Nimble 只会把你输入的文字发送给 %@，不发送其他任何内容。不会发送账号、联系人、位置或标识符，Nimble 也不会保留任何记录。如果你不允许，答案将只来自 DuckDuckGo 和维基百科。你可以随时在“设置”中更改。"
          }
        },
        "pa": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ਜਵਾਬ ਦੇਣ ਲਈ Nimble ਤੁਹਾਡਾ ਲਿਖਿਆ ਟੈਕਸਟ, ਹੋਰ ਕੁਝ ਨਹੀਂ, %@ ਨੂੰ ਭੇਜਦਾ ਹੈ। ਕੋਈ ਖਾਤਾ, ਸੰਪਰਕ, ਟਿਕਾਣਾ ਜਾਂ ਪਛਾਣ ਨਹੀਂ ਭੇਜੀ ਜਾਂਦੀ, ਅਤੇ Nimble ਇਸ ਦਾ ਕੋਈ ਰਿਕਾਰਡ ਨਹੀਂ ਰੱਖਦਾ। ਜੇ ਤੁਸੀਂ ਇਜਾਜ਼ਤ ਨਹੀਂ ਦਿੰਦੇ, ਤਾਂ ਜਵਾਬ ਸਿਰਫ਼ DuckDuckGo ਅਤੇ ਵਿਕੀਪੀਡੀਆ ਤੋਂ ਆਉਂਦੇ ਹਨ। ਤੁਸੀਂ ਇਹ ਸੈਟਿੰਗਾਂ ਵਿੱਚ ਬਦਲ ਸਕਦੇ ਹੋ।"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your key stays on this device and is sent only to %@.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
